WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
Dòmhnall MacFhionghain,

00:01.000 --> 00:05.000
’s tha mi a’ fuireach ann an Cnoc Cuidhein.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.000
Bidh mi a’ tighinn a-mach a Chreag Àrd

00:07.000 --> 00:09.000
a h-uile dà latha san t-seachdain

00:09.000 --> 00:11.000
Dimàirt agus Diciadain.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.000
Bidh sinn a’ gabhail tì an toiseach.

00:13.000 --> 00:15.000
Bidh sinn an uair sin a’ dèanamh fuirm

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
agus na stools,

00:17.000 --> 00:19.000
no ge be dè bhios againn ri dhèanamh.

00:19.000 --> 00:20.000
Bidh sinn an uair sin

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
a’ dol a Thaigh Chearsabhagh airson lunch,

00:22.000 --> 00:25.000
gu math tric sandwiches

00:25.000 --> 00:29.000
le tuna no salmon agus salad.

00:29.000 --> 00:31.000
Cha dèan mi ach na dealbhan a thaghadh

00:31.000 --> 00:34.000
seach gu bheil an taigh agamsa cho faisg air a’ mhuir.

00:34.000 --> 00:36.000
(Bha mi) riamh keen air bàtaichean,

00:36.000 --> 00:39.000
’s dol a dh’iasgach.

00:39.000 --> 00:40.000
An uair sin,

00:40.000 --> 00:42.000
nuair a bhios an centre a’ dol air tripichean

00:42.000 --> 00:46.000
as t-samhradh a Steòrnabhagh no dhan Eilean Sgitheanach

00:46.000 --> 00:47.000
bidh mi a’ falbh air na ferries.

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
Bidh mi ag obair sa Naafi –

00:49.000 --> 00:51.000
well, ’s e Lovats a th’ ann a-nis –

00:51.000 --> 00:53.000
trì latha san t-seachdain –

00:53.000 --> 00:55.000
Diluain ’s Dimàirt …

00:55.000 --> 00:58.000
Diluain ’s Diardaoin ’s Dihaoine.

00:58.000 --> 01:00.000
Aig a’ weekend bidh mi a-staigh

01:00.000 --> 01:02.000
ach a’ dol chun accordion and fiddle club

01:02.000 --> 01:05.000
a h-uile dàrna Disathairne air feadh a’ gheamhraidh,

01:05.000 --> 01:08.000
ach a dh’aithghearr bidh e deiseil airson an t-samhraidh.

01:09.000 --> 01:12.000
Chan eil aona note (agam) –

01:12.000 --> 01:14.000
ach dìreach a’ togail nan tuneichean

01:14.000 --> 01:18.000
bho tapeichean no CD no ge be càite eile an cluinn mi iad…

01:18.000 --> 01:21.000
a’ cluich coltach ri Iain MacLachlainn,

01:21.000 --> 01:23.000
no Bobby MacLeod, no Jimmy Shand,

01:23.000 --> 01:26.000
no fear dhe na h-old favourites.

01:26.000 --> 01:27.000
Fìor mhath.

01:28.000 --> 01:29.000
Okay well, mòran taing airson sin.

01:29.000 --> 01:39.000
No bother.